chmod 700 get_helm.sh -------> command to install helm 2nd command 
./get_helm.sh -------> command to install helm 3rd command 

helm version ----------> command to view helm version


helm repo add repository name what we wish https://charts.jenkins.io -----------> command to add repository in helm with name what we want 
